g/8S1fPNVsdIITQKFWyaijeKOpbIbSmLj1UGbP5lBmz-Y\"/><figcaption>不是黃金！70年代美國惡性通脹期間　表現最突出的是這2種資產（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T10:28:13.542474+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":923,"images":14,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}